{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51045","headline":"天坛 · 白元鉴","name":"天坛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天坛高百尺，只在翠微间。\n碧藓遗踪古，青松白日闲。\n丹成人已化，云去鹤应还。\n时有吹箫客，月明来故山。\n（同前。\n）（〖1〗《洞霄图志》卷四《古迹门·昇天坛》条：「旧志云：在大涤山中峯之上，又名法象坛。\n上应天而圆，下应地而方，中应《易》卦而八角。\n许远游真君精研洞典，登其上而仙去，时天降白鹿下迎，故中峯名白鹿山。\n今山顶界松内数丈之地，草木弗植，是其遗址也。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白元鉴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}